Mencari data musuh .

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.550
Monitam. itu aku !

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:04.680
Penyerangan termasuk Pencarian Musuh ,

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:11.650
Typeñez

